id: lord-of-balance
name: Lord of Balance
talentCategory: balance
prerequisites: Balanced Warrior, Balanced Defender
description: >
  The epitome of the balanced combat style, you are able to adapt offensively and defensively in equal measure.
text: >
  Lord of Balance: The epitome of the balanced combat style, you are able to adapt offensively and defensively in equal measure.
  –Prerequisites: Balanced Warrior, Balanced Defender
  (1)-[Passive]: If you are benefiting from the first effects of Balanced Warrior and Balanced Defender, increase your Combat Rolls by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Round]: Regain 3(bT) Life and Ki Points.

---

[passive]
# (1) Both Talents had, and the Scores each one's first effect asks for equal - Force and Magic, Agility and Tenacity.
if (benefiting("Balanced Warrior") && benefiting("Balanced Defender")
    && (force.score == magic.score) && (agility.score == tenacity.score)) {
    combatRolls += 1(T);
}

# (2) As each Combat Round starts, ticked on the Round's card.
[triggered/start-of-round, effect 2]
life.value += 3(bT);
ki.value += 3(bT);
